<title>USA: Advanced Micro extends CEO contract.</title>
<headline>Advanced Micro extends CEO contract.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Micro Devices Inc said it extended through the end of 2001 its contract with chairman and chief executive officer W.J. Sanders III.</p>
<p>Sanders, one of eight co-founders of Advanced Micro Devices, has been CEO since the company's inception in 1969.</p>
</text>
